  zone map 1439
  goto 35.719954,83.690005 map 1439 r 8
  note "This quest is VERY hard. Do it with another player if you can."
  note "Start the escort quest"
  note "Talk to Prospector Remtravel"
  accept 731 optional -- Accept The Absent Minded Prospector
step
  note "Escort Prospector Remtravel"
  note "Let Remtravel aggro everything (as mobs need to hit him for them to aggro him), then blast the mob with fireballs"
  note "Remtravel is really squishy, so try to take aggro off of him from the other mobs"
  note "When troggs spawn, polymorph the one he isn't attacking, then nuke the other one when it has hit him. Polymorph the mage first that spawns near the end AFTER it shoots a fireball at the prospector"
  note "If you can't do this quest first-time, just skip it - it is VERY skill-intensive and also very luck-based."
  complete 731 optional -- Escort Prospector Remtravel (1)
